        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>headphones_rendering_mode</name>
        <qualifiedname>AVIAMFSubmixElement::headphones_rendering_mode</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>A value that indicates whether the referenced channel-based Audio Element shall be rendered to stereo loudspeakers or spatialized with a binaural renderer when played back on headphones. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If the Audio Element is not of <ref refid="structAVIAMFAudioElement_1a3199850332a351361748c92b6cb8f8ad" kindref="member">type</ref> AV_IAMF_AUDIO_ELEMENT_TYPE_CHANNEL, then this field is undefined. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
