        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>annotations</name>
        <qualifiedname>AVIAMFSubmixElement::annotations</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>A dictionary of strings describing the submix in different languages. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Must have the same amount of entries as <ref refid="structAVIAMFMixPresentation_1ab33c73aa840d3e79e8acfee751d1f13c" kindref="member">the mix&apos;s annotations</ref>, stored in the same order, and with the same key strings.</para>
<para><ref refid="structAVDictionaryEntry_1a38fc80176f8f839282bb61c03392e194" kindref="member">key</ref> is a string conforming to BCP-47 that specifies the language for the string stored in <ref refid="structAVDictionaryEntry_1aa38678f2cad36f120d42e56449c5edb4" kindref="member">value</ref>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
